{"3517660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slime Dreamscape", "steam_appid": 3517660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517660/extras/065fd97256a43b2ac33833f162f2acf7.avif?t=1742307390\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517660/extras_big/065fd97256a43b2ac33833f162f2acf7.avif?t=1742307390 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slime Dreamscape</strong> is a 2D pixel-style puzzle casual game. The core mechanic of the game is that elements of the same color can interact with each other. Players will need to think strategically and make use of various items and mechanics to guide the slime successfully eats the cake.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Chapters and Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of themed chapters. With more than 65 levels to play, you'll encounter new challenges and ways to interact with the environment in each chapter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various interactive items and mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of in-game items, such as color changers, teleporters, gravity capsules, and more, to help the slime navigate through tricky obstacles. You'll need careful timing and creative thinking to overcome challenges and reach the cake in every level.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517660/extras/065fd97256a43b2ac33833f162f2acf7.avif?t=1742307390\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517660/extras_big/065fd97256a43b2ac3